  "_approach": "Break-science stutter: the tape-edit trick from the jungle_fill_amen_stutter fill stretched into a full riser - bar 1 holds a plain kick/snare/ride groove, then bar 2 stutter-edits both kick and snare together, doubling and displacing them as the spacing tightens from 8ths to 32nds, landing a combined kick+snare+crash hit on the penultimate 32nd and leaving the very last step silent. Ref: Remarc/Dillinja-style amen edit-science, KAN Samples' Amen-chopping guide.",
